{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Puppet.pdk","latestVersion":"3.4.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Key Puppet code development and testing tools","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/puppetlabs/pdk/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Key Puppet code development and testing tools","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/puppetlabs/pdk/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"The Puppet Development Kit (PDK) includes key Puppet code development and testing tools for Linux, Windows, and OS X workstations, so you can install one package with the tools you need to create and validate new modules.\nPDK includes testing tools, a complete module skeleton, and command line tools to help you create, validate, and run tests on Puppet modules. PDK also includes all dependencies needed for its use.","moniker":"pdk","name":"Puppet Development Kit","packageUrl":"https://github.com/puppetlabs/pdk","publisher":"Puppet Inc","publisherUrl":"https://www.puppet.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/puppetlabs/pdk/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md#v340---2024-11-25","tags":["puppet"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"Puppet 关键代码开发与测试工具","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Puppet 开发套件（PDK）为 Linux、Windows 和 OS X 工作站提供了关键的 Puppet 代码开发与测试工具。通过安装单一软件包，您即可获得创建及验证新模块所需的全部工具。\nPDK 包含测试工具、完整的模块框架以及命令行工具，可协助您创建、验证 Puppet 模块并运行测试。该套件同时集成了使用所需的所有依赖项。","tags":[]}},"longDescription":"The Puppet Development Kit (PDK) includes key Puppet code development and testing tools for Linux, Windows, and OS X workstations, so you can install one package with the tools you need to create and validate new modules.\nPDK includes testing tools, a complete module skeleton, and command line tools to help you create, validate, and run tests on Puppet modules. PDK also includes all dependencies needed for its use.","moniker":"pdk","name":"Puppet Development Kit","packageUrl":"https://github.com/puppetlabs/pdk","pu